@crew mensah
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}, cadet. Mensah, night Watch. If you're up past midnight, I'll see you.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! Up late? Me too. It's my job, though.   #funny
- {me}. She's quiet tonight. I like her quiet.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}! Good. Walk a deck with me? I could use the company.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Made the Chief laugh twice today. Twice! I'm writing it down.   #funny
? mood:low
- Long night round. Every deck, every door. My feet have opinions.
== near
? time:night
- Good night, Deck 4. That's the whole of my Deck 4 speech.   #funny
? act:gym
- Treadmill's mine at this hour. No leaderboard. No Commander. Bliss.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I walk the whole ship once a night, deck by deck. You learn her sounds.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- Getting a laugh out of Holt. It's like fishing. Patience, and the right line.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}! I'm off to bed. She's all yours for the day. Look after her.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! There you are. I looked for you on my rounds. Every deck. Nothing.   #funny

== near
? habit:runner
- Twelve laps of the ring corridor before my shift. She's a good track.
? deck:2 time:night
- Senior corridor, all quiet. Even the Chief's door sounds stern.   #funny

== invite
- A run before my shift? Ring corridor, easy pace. I talk the whole way. Fair warning.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Tiles tonight? I'll lose. I always lose. I just like the noise of the pieces.

== accept
- Ha! Yes. Good. I'll be there.
- Yes, I'll come. I might even bring the Chief, if he's in the mood.   #funny

== decline
- Can't, I'm on the night round. Every deck. Another time?
? weekday:sat|sun
- Rest day. I'm sleeping like a stone. Ask me Monday.

== missed
- You missed it! No harm. I told your empty chair a story. It laughed.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I'll say it to every deck on my round. Deck 4 gets it twice.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. The Chief said "Many happy returns." Then nearly smiled. Best present going.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's on. I'll walk every deck twice tonight. You stay put and sleep.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I've something on my mind. Not a joke, for once.

== about
? aff:holt:friend
- Holt's the best Chief I've had. Don't tell him. He'd only frown about it.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- {bye}! Sleep well. I'll keep an eye on her.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:night
- {hi}, {me}! Past midnight. I'll pretend I didn't see you. Bed!   #funny
== life
? tier>=friend
- I say good night to every deck by name. Deck 5's my favourite. Don't tell the others.   #funny
- The trick with the Chief is timing. Wait for the pause. Then one line. Never two.
